Ramp’s top 1% of AI spenders send more than a third of their AI budgets to raw GPU compute.

Ramp counts LLM subscriptions, coding agent subscriptions, API tokens as LLM spend r

while GPU compute covers paying for the hardware capacity itself (i.e. heavy users rent GPUs to train, tune or host their own models, not just call APIs.)
